                  "typeName": "dsDescriptionValue",
                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "The data presented here were collected as part of the PICKA project:<br>\n<b>data_jvo_responses_ci.csv</b><br>\nCSV file with the results of CI Dutch children's discrimination of differences in fundamental frequency (F0) and vocal tract length (VTL) - PICKA Fishy experiment <br>\n\n<b>data_gen_responses_ci.csv</b><br>\nCSV file with the results of CI Dutch children's categorization of voice gender as a function of differences in F0 and VTL - PICKA Gender experiment <br>\n\n<b>data_crm_responses_ci.csv</b><br>\nCSV file with the results of Dutch CI children's ability to perceive speech in competing speech - PICKA CRM experiment <br>\n\n<b>data_demographics_ci.csv</b><br>\nCSV file with demographic data of CI children (subject number, age, age group, gender, vocabulary score, age at implantation, and hearing age)"
                }
              }
